{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "d4c464d40301f99162aa532799113b6459d0123bcb77a97c35c0dffea3d11476", "ja": "チアライブの奇跡", "zh": "啦啦队演出的奇迹", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5eda84137dfdf397d5963c7297e55efffeec4e933882240ffa8368a2ec709ba6", "ja": "チアで中央エリアの振興に貢献したからと、\n表彰された一同。式や取材を終え、ふと駅前\n広場に足を向ける。周囲に人が集まり、せっ\nかくだからとゲリラライブを始める4人を、\n離れて見つめる女の子の姿があった。", "zh": "因为通过啦啦队为中央地区振兴作出了贡献，\n大家受到了表彰。结束仪式和采访后，不经意间\n朝车站前广场走去。周围聚集起人群，大家想着\n难得来一次，便开始了快闪演出。有个女孩远远\n地注视着这4人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b8ff77c59ad59233bc5d50f5b722317133758f0db871d6a11e745c1acf69537c", "ja": "（駅前でのチアライブは、中央エリアの活気に大いに\n貢献したと評価され、表彰される事になった！）", "zh": "（车站前的啦啦队演出被认为大大提升了中央区域的活力，因此我们还将受到表彰！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e4b5dff64551fd4e832d616501529c6dabbc39222aa3c3300978d1120adecd69", "ja": "（表彰式とそれに関する取材を終えた後、\nみんなでやって来たのは……）", "zh": "（结束了表彰仪式和相关采访后，大家一起来到的地方是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "f322875125ac2945c4df2c75cface908a4e10fd50cc89e44775b02d3f3271aa6", "ja": "まだそんなに経ってないはずなのに……\nちょっと、懐かしく見えちゃうね。", "zh": "明明应该还没过去多久……\n却感觉有点令人怀念呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "df38b661a4f1b87df64c2799f6adfc82f9c848f2f0ba11fc1500c227cbb4aefb", "ja": "そうだな……。朝も昼も、ここで\n通る人達を、応援してたんだよな……。", "zh": "是啊……不管早上还是中午，我们都曾在这里为路过的人们加油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bdbdea975b3c717a6c200391708cfc401142a75babaee2f6fb1abeae5fc7b753", "ja": "ジュリアも、最後はしっかりお客さんを見てたしな。\n見事なチアだったよ！", "zh": "就连茱莉亚，最后也一直认真看着观众呢。真是精彩的啦啦队表演啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "db019f5df3da6f0b9edbc5007ca5ed033ef1692ecf67a31c36e8dee2e6a94ee7", "ja": "ちょっ……恥ずかしいことを\n思い出させるなよ、バカP！", "zh": "等、别让我想起这么丢人的事啊，笨蛋制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "f396261004937f2ce242ccc0b0812a4cd3c9e583eccaf30e3373778db25ecd5e", "ja": "たくさん応援しましたよね……。\nみんなに、届いてたらいいなぁ。", "zh": "我们给了很多支持吧……  \n要是能传达到大家那里就好了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "36397e7a7b922b282516be2b3e2e0ea1e85de5fe0a8722fefbb02fa3af0ae068", "ja": "うん……。あの、メールの子……\nどこで、見てくれてたの……かな……。", "zh": "嗯……那个……发邮件的孩子……\n她是在哪里看着的……呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "90de8af64f690081b6867c264028e49df623189aaadb2d6aa86529db6566d37b", "ja": "そういえば、その事だけど……\nあの子は、地元の子じゃなかったみたいだな。", "zh": "说起来，关于那件事……\n那孩子好像不是当地人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "4193584ab6dbd8100c8d2e7b680418a2a0eaf2c7be53e594b3c2e239b98ce3c1", "ja": "えっ、そうだったんですか！？", "zh": "诶，原来是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f3cf9e1f94829c12f271a065c5444b037ccdf47142b97a419adcb08ac0ba5d50", "ja": "チアライブは生配信もしてたから、毎回、\n結構な人数が見ていたんだけど……。", "zh": "啦啦队演出还会进行直播，所以每次都有不少人观看，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0a9b36c83f0043512fa445e46bc4164498fea21c1715608b2b2659c33b513ef2", "ja": "あの子は、それを見ていたみたいだ。", "zh": "那孩子好像一直在看直播。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "e814727f7aa88653e18e01f3c4200bc82df62c5853b0af7210d5544980f20730", "ja": "そうだったのか……。\nてっきり、現地にいるのかと思ってたよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n我还以为她人在现场呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "baddec4224c3d3ba7c3905ba825910bae1bb7d361ce55f16e2f0df00f7d96ed3", "ja": "来たくても、来れなかったのかもね……。\nでも、画面越しにも応援は届いてたってことだよ！", "zh": "就算想来，也可能没能来吧……\n不过，这也说明即使隔着屏幕，我们的加油也传达到了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "ecd3b3a820e93b039237760ae1041526049cc74db2006275cdb473a9b1f5724e", "ja": "そっか……私たちの応援は、\n中央エリアも飛び越えてたってことですよね！？", "zh": "这样啊……也就是说，我们的加油声甚至跨越了中央区域，传达到了对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "a46080c212ee57b3ee408231e4406ec893a534d06d578b61999c2c9826e5cbe7", "ja": "どこにいても……必ず、伝わるんだね……。\n応援の力って、すごい……。", "zh": "无论身在何处……都一定能传达到呢……。\n加油的力量，真厉害……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "ec84e32335af10feccf7c7e0ef25dd4bf8b516c173b4ffeda9ca8cd401b22b6f", "ja": "う～……！　私なんだか、\n応援したくなってきちゃいました！", "zh": "呜～……！我不知不觉也想给大家加油了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "06880d542c2260f978dbe6ce2b374fb7e71a6d4b0721cd59dbc823802263b3a9", "ja": "フレーフレー！　みんな！\nフレーフレー！　私たち！", "zh": "加油加油！大家！\n加油加油！我们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "bec9e26cdc34e21b133224420dd16ff6fc7680efccf38cc1274fff6c79752e08", "ja": "いや、本当に応援するのかよ！？", "zh": "不是，你还真加油助威起来了啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "d09f524bdb77d91c3095880efb25bde20fb7cbaa547221edaa34c04ac71fd88c", "ja": "でも、なんだか楽しそう。\n私も可奈ちゃんと一緒に、応援しちゃおうかな？", "zh": "不过，感觉好像很开心。\n我也和可奈一起给她加油好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "42052a673a01f3a6365870c6da224050c1a2a463f9265a725b9914b553c8f1e4", "ja": "はは。我慢できなくて応援しちゃうなんて、\nみんなすっかりチアガールだな。", "zh": "哈哈。都忍不住要给她加油了，大家已经完全是啦啦队员了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1021_josikosei1", "source_sha256": "b6ae8ad7a1ccd7e08f00215ca75a3fb1a2d7bd51e079f5091dc93e342a34fe95", "ja": "ねぇ……あれって、ジュリアちゃんじゃない？", "zh": "喂……那不是茱莉亚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1022_josikosei2", "source_sha256": "0c9d36d9a0377bf17109daa939594e0d8f8f18024ed2c0dc2c72d6e1b47fd24f", "ja": "春香ちゃん、可奈ちゃん、杏奈ちゃんもいるよ！\nチアライブのメンバーだよね？", "zh": "春香、可奈、杏奈也在哦！\n是啦啦队演唱会的成员吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "10193cdfec68d75bbe6eadd699321f48e342aa58f4f8cf13d8633dcde46967de", "ja": "はれっ！？　なんだか騒がしくなって\nきちゃった！　ど、どうしよう～！？", "zh": "咦！？不知不觉变得热闹起来了！怎、怎么办呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "87df7c3f43ebb5fe36258642b0c605458752a8616dd6bb8e9dfb402499ae6ba5", "ja": "可奈が歌って踊るからだろ？　……仕方ない。\n特別にもう一回くらい、いいよな？", "zh": "都是因为可奈又唱又跳，才变得这么热闹吧？……没办法。\n特别再来一次，应该也可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "28339a6b9d2ee6a775ca4197543f50ce24ea254c45af9f68955a325082632094", "ja": "そうだね。集まってくれたみんなに、応えないと……。\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "是啊。得回应聚集而来的大家才行……  \n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "89c13b0a71fe13f8f1e1fc4fef7062315e6f2e5c5914da677155c61746d1c158", "ja": "確かに表彰式の時「これからもご自由に！」とは\n言われたけども……ま、やるしかないか！", "zh": "颁奖典礼上确实说了\"今后请随意！\"……\n不过，也只能干了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c9078c5b530f407c6739702f3313cb697d727a7ee04a13a17ef4e6b20a1f0e1e", "ja": "ちょっと責任者の人に連絡してくるから、\nみんなはこの場をうまく盛り上げてくれ！", "zh": "我去联系一下负责人，  \n大家把现场气氛炒热起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "9ac30959a850362f9a0fc8262223325ff8b603c643d8a362560704838e0bb53f", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！\n杏奈ちゃん、いこう！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生！\n杏奈，我们上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "c74a9d0c974e1e7369155c7dc64a0402880c1935f2c9d9680da4614c3ebd7fb3", "ja": "それじゃあ、突然だけど……\n特別に、杏奈達がビビッと応援しちゃうよ～！", "zh": "那么，虽然有点突然……\n特别为你，杏奈她们来给你活力满满地加油啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1030_tukou2", "source_sha256": "7b3fe9a1f07e5a083a686db0b2c2dcc9bede1b7e63412cc47169922353625973", "ja": "わぁーーーーっ！！", "zh": "哇————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "9cbc4fe4137c278cf706c9f7da945fb7f0f65bd8045c1c68c412c3a68d7726b2", "ja": "（まさかのゲリラライブになってしまった……。\nでも、みんなも周りの人たちも、いい笑顔だな）", "zh": "（没想到竟然变成了突袭式现场演出……\n不过，大家和周围的人脸上都洋溢着灿烂的笑容呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "88e5347981982af23b10af9dc91921d2ab6fa16146914c527e472c6e2460d1c4", "ja": "（この光景に、俺もパワーをもらえた気がする。\nツアーのフィナーレに向けて……頑張らないとな！）", "zh": "这个场景似乎也给了我力量。为了巡演的终场……我可得加油了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "6684aeb076051b57686de549bbf2792851ffa4998a3581561aff1ccee0e2f350", "ja": "みんなー！　ステージから目を離したらダメだからね！\n杏奈達のエール、しっかり受け取って！", "zh": "大家——！千万不能把目光从舞台上移开哦！\n杏奈她们的声援，要好好收下哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1034_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "33845ab766edce45ae2a95d3bdc80d720e6e51842da1d687475685e90bf5dc3a", "ja": "うそ……うそみたい……！！", "zh": "骗人的……简直像做梦一样……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1035_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "826a14ac38bbe6c6dd1c454fe64f40a2a164ad823b7220a54188c2d14b20cf53", "ja": "（聖地巡礼のつもりで来たのに……。\nまさか、チアライブが生で見れるなんて……！）", "zh": "（本来是抱着圣地巡礼的心情来的……\n没想到居然能亲眼看到应援演出……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1036_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "2f4457b65c4c463e9d605fd54a3d11163d7b8ca8bb2262506771edb9aa844cb4", "ja": "（杏奈ちゃん、みんな。私、頑張る……！！\n……あっ、こっち見た……！）", "zh": "（杏奈，大家。我会努力的……！！\n……啊，她看过来了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1037_024ann", "source_sha256": "865e00cbeef1e8299ae335464817d5a2e0c20faba88b67b7a5de93e1ab33dccc", "ja": "頑張ってる人も、疲れて休んでる人も、\nみーんなまとめて、杏奈たちが応援するよ！", "zh": "无论是正在努力的人，还是累了正在休息的人，\n杏奈她们都会统统为大家加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_07_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "752031156c15a18664a427c445d97fe0dc09e1816efa3d899f279867a52025c5", "ja": "杏奈たちの応援で、ビビッと充電していって！\nそれじゃあ、いっくよー！", "zh": "用杏奈她们的支持，让自己精神满满地充好电吧！\n那么，要上咯——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
